WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
You do not need the right words. It is okay to say, 'I do not know where to start.'

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
1. Dial. NCMH crisis line: 1553 (toll-free). Other numbers are on the Crisis help page.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
2. A trained person answers. They are there to listen, not to judge you.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
3. Share what you want. You can say as much or as little as feels okay.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
4. They ask how you are. And help you think about the next step.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
In danger right now?. Call 911. Then tell an adult you trust.

